  "description": "Ménage à trois? More like menace à trois!\n\nAs a bashful, introverted BL lover, all Min-Ji Kim ever wanted for her final year of middle school was to be left alone to draw dinosaur-themed superhero smut -- Ahem, tasteful fanfiction. So exactly how she became part of the so-called Future Vision Club with school rebel Hae-In Shin and straight-laced student Ji-Su Han, she’ll never quite understand. The only thing that’s clear is that the year ahead promises to be unforgettable, to say the least! So, prepare for trouble and make it… triple?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON, edited)",
